EQ_gt7         bound: idata > 7
EQ_maskhi      bound: (idata & ~7ULL) nonzero
EQ_ge8lit      bound: idata >= 8 (literal, not the macro)
EQ_acc_and7    accept: current_port = idata & 7 (idata is 0..7 here)
EQ_acc_castint accept: current_port = (int) idata
