BR_no_hi32     bound: refuse only idata in [8, 2^32) -- accepts wide values
BR_acc_map0    accept: 0 stored as 1 -- expect A red
BR_rd_drop0    read: odata = current_port & 6 -- expect A red
BR_acc_w8      joint accept x width: store an out-of-range value written by sd
BR_ann_gt8     joint announce x value: announce only for idata > 8 (8 silent)
BR_refuse_lt   bound: refuse idata >= 7 (7 refused) -- expect A/W red
