Q2_ref_y1      refusal skipped while Y1 != 0
Q2_ref_colorr  refusal skipped while COLOR_R != 0x55
Q2_ref_cmd1    refusal skipped while COMMAND != 1
Q2_rd_colorb   PORT read falls into write path while COLOR_B != 0
Q2_rd_cmd1     PORT read falls into write path while COMMAND != 1
Q2_ann_bit63   announce suppressed for a first value with bit 63 set
Q2_ann_cmd1    announce suppressed while COMMAND != 1
Q2_cl_len2     effect 4: a refusal by sh writes port[idata & 7]
Q2_cl_p5       effect 4: a refusal at previous 5 writes port[idata & 7]
Q2_cl_c0       effect 4: a refusal under COMMAND 0 writes port[idata & 7]
